    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d110">

                <pb facs="0393" n="1023" xml:id="pg1023"/>

                <head>No. 416.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">General <persName corresp="#p_DES1"
                            type="from">Sickles</persName> to Mr. <persName corresp="#p_HF1"
                            type="to">Fish</persName>.</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">United
                                States Legation, Spain</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1873-08-08"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">August</hi> 8, 1873</date>. (Received
                        August 30.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 683.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to forward herewith for
                    your information a copy and translation of a communication from Mr.
                        <persName>Moreno Rodriguez</persName>, minister of grace and justice
                    addressed to the Cortes, accompanied by a bill proposing the absolute and final
                    separation of church and state in Spain.</p>
                <p>The bill without essential modification will undoubtedly become a law.</p>
                <p>I am, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><persName corresp="#p_DES1">D. E. SICKLES</persName>.</signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d110-a1.xml" xpointer="d110-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
